  "description": "SimpleDataValidation is an open-source .NET library for validating data in a simple and intuitive way.\n\t\tYou just need to call one of validation static method of the V class, passing the name of the data and its value.\n\t\tThen if the validation failed, the function returns an error message or an empty string if validation finished successfully.\n\t\tThere are many available features to validate data, by type, by length, and by format like: NotNull, Length, StartsWith, Email, Iban, Card Number,...",
